WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:04.320
It's tailgate season in America and I'm tired of everyone just ordering burgers on their phone

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:09.760
So I'm putting the challenge out there to Mia to see what she can come up with in just 10 minutes

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:13.180
Mia, don't disappoint. Welcome to "Ramsay in 10".

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.820
Hi guys! I'm Mia Castro, I'm the challenge Queen from Hell's Kitchen

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.320
Today Gordon challenged me to make a burger in under 10 Minutes

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.360
so I'm making my version of a

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:32.848
Tailgate turkey burger with an avocado spread and I'm adding some potato sticks for a little bit of crunch too

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:36.870
So like any good football competition, Gordon you're on. Let's start

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:38.309
So right here

00:00:38.309 --> 00:00:40.309
I have some ground turkey

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:46.400
What I like to add to turkey burger is because sometimes they end up being on the dry side is some zucchini

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.900
To keep them moist and I'm just gonna grate it right into here

00:00:51.879 --> 00:00:53.969
And if you don't have one of these at home

00:00:53.969 --> 00:00:58.589
You can just use a box grater or kind of just like rough chop it yourself

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.860
And I have some pre-chopped garlic

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:14.140
I have some smoked paprika and I like using this because

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:19.160
It gives food that sort of like ham or bacon flavor

00:01:19.869 --> 00:01:22.859
We're gonna try to add as much flavor as we can into the meat

00:01:23.409 --> 00:01:25.499
Everyone needs to chill out on measuring

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:30.500
I just I throw things in there and you can just taste it as you go take a little piece of burger

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:34.060
Throw it on the grill, taste it, if it needs more, add more

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.500
some salt

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.400
pepper

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:49.310
Stir that up

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:53.560
And if you're having people over for game day, you can just make these patties ahead of time

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:58.060
So when you have your guests over all you have to do is throw them on the grill or on the pan

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:01.119
We don't really watch that much football in Puerto Rico

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:08.139
At least my family didn't, but for any game day like if it's a boxing match or for us

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:10.140
It's actually the Miss Universe pageant

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:16.720
Then I'm gonna pre-boil the pan real quick because I'm about to use my hands

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.300
to form these patties

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:23.340
So the thinner the patty the faster its gonna cook it's really up to you

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:28.260
how thick you want it. I'm trying to prove Gordon right though. So I want to finish this in 10 minutes

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.800
Then right on the pan

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:40.460
When you get the burger on you want to make sure that your heat is on medium-high

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:46.720
I like it when it gets kind of crispy around it. And that's why I actually prefer turkey burgers to beef burgers

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:54.520
You want a list of ingredients - just check the description below. While that's cooking, I'm gonna make a quick sauce with avocados

00:02:56.630 --> 00:03:02.859
And this is a good substitution for mayonnaise and cheese. That way you don't feel like crap after you eat a burger

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:07.380
Sorry this pit is

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.220
Not cooperating

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:20.580
If the pit's not cooperating just take it out with a fork

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:25.020
But these knives are so sharp. They're cutting through the pit

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.080
Gordon do you actually even use your knives here? They're so sharp

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.960
All right, whatever.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.080
We're still good! I got this, Gordon

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:47.500
So just a little bit of salt, some lemon juice

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:56.020
This is something else that you can pre make ahead of time and a little bit of olive oil

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.040
Then just mash it up with a fork

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:11.340
Alright, so don't forget your burger. I'm gonna oil it on top again a little bit so it gets nice and brown on the other side

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.440
We're gonna toast our patty

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:21.840
So, get a little bit of butter on there. So it gets a really good golden brown color.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:26.960
I actually like to season the buns a little bit so you actually taste the butter

00:04:32.699 --> 00:04:38.449
Straight down, I think we're gonna make it, Gordon. One nice slice of tomato

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:44.160
And you can top it with whatever you want, these are just my favorite things

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.920
Flatten it

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:51.240
Check your buns, don't burn them.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:59.240
Oh, so I'm getting the lettuce flat so it covers

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:03.680
The bun really nice and I get two pieces on there. I like to put it in the bottom

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.760
so that the juice from the turkey burger doesn't

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.540
Make the bun soggy

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.569
going with

00:05:12.569 --> 00:05:14.400
Turkey right on top

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:19.879
So, you know if it's done by kind of poking it in the middle and if it feels firm, it's ready to go

00:05:20.789 --> 00:05:22.789
Let's check our bun

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:26.330
Perfect

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:29.419
I like to season my tomato.

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.020
A little olive oil as well.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:42.040
It's getting really close now these avocados could have ruined me. I think they still have it though.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:51.560
Magic touch..."papitas" (potatoes in spanish) get a lot of them on there. That's what makes it really good

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:56.760
And time is ticking so I got to get this on

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.110
There we go.

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:05.720
Oh my God, I think that was just ten minutes. Gordon, you almost had me but there you go. Tailgate turkey burgers in ten minutes

